@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Report Versions

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Sourcing Officer / Reports
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Version history of the tender’s reports (OfficerComparison,
FullEvaluation, ExecutiveSummary).

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Sourcing Officer

ROUTE: /SourcingOfficer/Reports/History/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Query TenderReports of the tender ordered by ReportType,
  VersionNumber; follow PreviousReportId.

DEPENDENCIES:
TenderReports.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Required report lifecycle step (spec §4.4, §4.6, §11); no
Trello card covers it — team assignment required.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Report Versions";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Reports";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Every version of every report of a tender, with who reviewed it and what they decided.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-versions">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-versions">Versions</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Report</th><th scope="col">Version</th><th scope="col">Previous version</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Submitted</th><th scope="col">Reviewed by</th><th scope="col">Decision</th><th scope="col">Comment</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="8"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No report versions yet."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<nav class="pg-links" aria-label="Related pages">
    <ul>
        <li><a asp-area="SourcingOfficer" asp-controller="Reports" asp-action="Index">All reports</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
